+# Password Hashing
+
+This project's current recorded decision is to use argon2id as the password hashing algorithm. The decision was stated directly by the project owner and is the only one currently on record for password hashing; no parameters (memory cost, iterations, parallelism, salt length) have been recorded, so none are specified here.
